WEBVTT

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:21.500
These were on Tsukishiro.

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:35.380
This is a lot...

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:39.630
That should be enough to take
 care of you and your mother.

00:00:41.590 --> 00:00:45.270
Thank you... Thank you so much!

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:46.870
Listen closely...

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:49.550
Don't ever look back.

00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:52.060
Once you're out of here, 
forget anything you ever saw.

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:53.070
Got it?

00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:56.030
Right!

00:01:00.190 --> 00:01:03.960
It'd probably be a good idea 
to <i>thoroughly</i> clean things up.

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:06.340
Right. And I intend to.

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:18.950
You know too much.

00:01:20.150 --> 00:01:23.220
People will betray you, 
whether friend or foe.

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:25.560
There's no ruling someone's heart.

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:17.900
<b>Book 3: Revolution to Change the World</b>

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:15.460
<b>Episode 10: Confidential File 089, Star Sign</b>

00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:27.720
The dosage wasn't right. 
We'll need to revise our calculations.

00:03:33.290 --> 00:03:35.780
Bring the next one, 633, in here.

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:44.370
<b>638</b>

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:43.860
How long do you think this 
is going to go on?

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.540
For as long as we survive.

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:48.820
Then I'm gonna try to run!

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:51.370
Iori... I've made up my mind, too.

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:54.960
I'm gonna use this. 
I managed to stash it away.

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:56.630
Let's kill the guards and get out of here!

00:03:56.990 --> 00:03:58.660
Run to where?

00:03:58.660 --> 00:03:59.840
Well...

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:02.470
I mean, there <i>has</i> to be somewhere!

00:04:02.850 --> 00:04:05.970
There's nowhere to run. I'm gonna die.

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:07.990
Wait! Yoshio!

00:04:14.380 --> 00:04:15.680
Yoshio?

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:23.740
633, 633...

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:26.800
Great, another one to dispose of.

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:29.450
Janome-sama is not going to be happy.

00:04:30.170 --> 00:04:31.200
In that case...

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:35.710
Take me instead.

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:47.220
<b>638</b>

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:47.220
638 did this?

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:49.720
Inform the shogun!

00:04:57.320 --> 00:04:58.260
Over there!

00:04:58.260 --> 00:04:59.250
Don't let him escape!

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:01.860
<i>I'm not giving up!</i>

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:04.340
A village!

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:13.770
Oh, no...

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:16.440
There's nowhere to run!

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:17.740
Don't move!

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:19.570
Damn it...

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:26.720
<b>Nue</b>

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:28.290
A Nue agent?

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:32.300
Nue?

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:52.110
The shogun has chosen you.

00:05:53.480 --> 00:05:55.180
The shogun?

00:05:55.180 --> 00:05:56.970
Is that the snake bastard's boss?

00:05:56.970 --> 00:06:02.190
The shogun regrets Professor 
Janome's barbaric experiments.

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:05.340
I'm not going back.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:08.350
A new path has been prepared for you.

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:10.840
What new path?

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:13.820
Defy his will, and die.

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:20.100
What is this path?

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:30.220
During his escape from the lab, 
he killed 38 fellow subjects

00:06:30.220 --> 00:06:33.040
and 14 guards.

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:44.800
What you see is

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:49.650
the result of the experiments: he's developed 
a resistance to 120 types of snake venom.

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:54.450
He has a strong body and mind,

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:57.770
along with a powerful thirst for life. 
A perfect candidate.

00:06:59.390 --> 00:07:00.660
Turn around.

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:19.090
An amusing jest, sir.

00:07:19.090 --> 00:07:22.420
You are to be walking down
 a path fraught with carnage.

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:26.250
You will demonstrate your resolve 
to live in service to me.

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:28.510
Resolve?

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:31.210
Clean up the spilled wine.

00:07:31.210 --> 00:07:33.510
How? With what?

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:35.760
You can lick it up, can't you?

00:07:36.570 --> 00:07:42.160
If even a drop is left, we can 
still send him back to Janome.

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:44.990
As you wish, sir.

00:07:46.430 --> 00:07:49.890
<i>There's nowhere to run. I'm gonna die.</i>

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:33.730
Jin Kuzuhara.

00:08:36.090 --> 00:08:37.870
That is your name now.

00:08:38.170 --> 00:08:41.270
It represents Yoshinobu-sama's 
desire for you to be the one

00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:44.250
who clears away the trash of this world.

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:47.790
Jin Kuzuhara...

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:53.520
From now on, you will live a 
new life under your new name.

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:54.880
Do you have any questions?

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:58.440
What am I supposed to call you?

00:08:58.440 --> 00:09:00.350
I have no name.

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:03.720
But Yoshinobu-sama has taken 
to calling me "Kotodama."

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:04.520
Koto...

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:05.870
Kotodama.

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:08.770
It refers to the supernatural 
force behind one's words.

00:09:10.470 --> 00:09:12.970
It might be easier to understand 
if you think about the concept

00:09:12.970 --> 00:09:14.870
of "saying a wish out loud 
to make it come true."

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:17.390
Is that right?

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:22.140
The shogun's desire is for you to become 
a suitable member of our organization.

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:23.360
What organization?

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:25.040
This one.

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:26.540
<b>Nue</b>

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:31.970
<i>In order to preserve peace, the shogun 
has created a secret organization.</i>

00:09:31.970 --> 00:09:33.550
<i>It is called "Nue."</i>

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:41.550
<i>Our objective is to remove all 
threats to the shogun in secret.</i>

00:09:45.050 --> 00:09:46.960
Please, don't kill—

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:48.340
<i>Throw away your sentimentality.</i>

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:51.950
<i>Your life belongs to Yoshinobu 
Tokugawa-sama from this point on.</i>

00:09:56.470 --> 00:09:57.980
The snake has betrayed us.

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:03.940
Why would the snake suddenly 
decide to defy the shogun?

00:10:03.940 --> 00:10:06.790
People will betray you, 
whether friend or foe.

00:10:07.350 --> 00:10:09.630
There's no ruling someone's heart.

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:13.340
Hence the need for us.

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:15.130
What about the research documents?

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:18.210
Janome fled with all of it.

00:10:18.210 --> 00:10:21.750
It will be hard to resume research
 into immortality without it.

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:25.390
He's going to become a threat 
to us... to the shogun.

00:10:25.880 --> 00:10:29.650
Not only that, but Janome has set 
his sights on the infamous blue blood.

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:31.370
The blue blood...

00:10:31.370 --> 00:10:35.240
From the Karasumori clan, 
who are said to have special powers.

00:10:36.230 --> 00:10:38.290
I've been given a message for you.

00:10:39.640 --> 00:10:42.800
You are to guard the Karasumori clan.

00:10:47.030 --> 00:10:49.420
<i>Strike down any suspicious 
individuals who approach.</i>

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:04.640
<i>Carry out your duty without 
drawing the villagers' attention.</i>

00:11:23.900 --> 00:11:28.010
<i>There are beasts in the woods that have been 
affected by the flow of power in the area.</i>

00:11:28.630 --> 00:11:30.240
<i>Be very cautious.</i>

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:42.680
No!

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:50.120
Dwell in the blue that surges within!

00:11:57.610 --> 00:12:00.530
Please stop. She was only 
trying to protect her pups.

00:12:03.190 --> 00:12:04.700
A mother?

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:07.880
You're one of Yoshinobu-sama's 
men, aren't you?

00:12:08.380 --> 00:12:09.700
How do you know that?

00:12:10.130 --> 00:12:15.390
The village elders told us that 
Yoshinobu-sama would protect our clan.

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:19.170
I'm not sure you need protection, 
with power like that.

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:21.360
Not all of us can do this.

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:28.090
We take no pleasure in fighting. 
So please, lower your weapon.

00:12:28.090 --> 00:12:29.890
After you.

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:32.480
Will you promise me you won't hurt them?

00:12:33.120 --> 00:12:34.420
She's going to maul me.

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:37.480
She just wants them safe, 
even if it costs her life.

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:39.440
She wants to protect her children.

00:12:39.850 --> 00:12:42.240
I'm a mother, too, so I understand.

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:49.560
Mom! Mom!

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:54.860
Thank you.

00:12:56.870 --> 00:12:59.970
Your injury isn't too severe, 
but it should probably be tended to.

00:13:00.900 --> 00:13:04.520
My name is Towa Karasumori. What's yours?

00:13:07.860 --> 00:13:08.970
I'm...

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:44.300
What's that?

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.480
Are you okay?

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:25.760
Pain, pain, go away...

00:14:29.530 --> 00:14:31.170
I have another message.

00:14:32.060 --> 00:14:35.590
The Karasumori clan is to be eliminated.

00:14:35.590 --> 00:14:38.020
Eliminated? He wants me to kill them?

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:43.270
They were asked to use their special powers 
to contribute to the Tokugawa regime,

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:47.190
but they would not consent, 
and they seem to be beyond negotiation.

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:49.130
Not only that,

00:14:49.130 --> 00:14:52.760
but we have intel that suggests 
Janome has nearly found the village.

00:14:52.760 --> 00:14:54.700
There is no time to waste.

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:57.700
I'll kill Janome, then.

00:14:58.060 --> 00:15:00.250
Even if you killed him,

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:03.210
there'd be no end to those seeking 
the power of the blue blood.

00:15:03.640 --> 00:15:06.480
There's no way for them 
to stay hidden forever.

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:10.440
And it may bud in the spring...

00:15:11.330 --> 00:15:16.100
<i>You, of all people, should be able to imagine 
the cruelty they'd be faced with.</i>

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:19.890
<i>Yoshinobu-sama's commands are absolute.</i>

00:15:20.470 --> 00:15:22.690
<i>Defiance is not tolerated.</i>

00:15:29.460 --> 00:15:33.030
Look at you. You must be hungry.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:39.230
Come and have something to eat.

00:15:39.230 --> 00:15:41.130
I'll have to pass on that.

00:15:41.130 --> 00:15:42.710
I figured as much.

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:45.670
Here.

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:49.680
I've got a son, and he 
definitely has an appetite.

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:52.160
So I thought you might be the same.

00:15:52.950 --> 00:15:55.930
Is that bird always with you?

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:58.580
Not necessarily.

00:15:58.580 --> 00:16:03.240
But members of the Karasumori are 
chosen by birds to be their partners.

00:16:03.240 --> 00:16:06.360
She's a one-of-a-kind friend, 
and one I'll spend my life with.

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:08.190
A friend...

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:10.410
Do you have any friends?

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:16.650
Well, if you get hungry, come on down.

00:16:16.650 --> 00:16:19.210
It'll be fun to have another son around.

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:28.080
Thank you for always looking out for us.

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:51.210
I wonder what's going on...

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:54.270
Hey, what are these rice balls for?

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:56.480
Those?

00:17:57.640 --> 00:17:59.720
They're dinner for our guardian spirit.

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:01.770
What does that mean?

00:18:01.770 --> 00:18:05.100
Sawa! Wanna race to see who
 can set out the futons faster?

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:06.540
Oh, I do!

00:18:06.540 --> 00:18:08.730
All right, get ready.

00:18:09.110 --> 00:18:11.230
Of course he's not coming...

00:18:18.330 --> 00:18:19.610
Oh, welcome!

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:25.730
Are you crying?

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:30.380
It's okay.

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:43.510
No! Don't!

00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:15.460
<i>She just wants them safe, 
even if it costs her life.</i>

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:17.690
She wants to protect her children.

00:19:17.690 --> 00:19:19.800
I'm a mother, too, so I understand.

00:19:20.320 --> 00:19:23.550
Thank you for always looking out for us.

00:19:25.050 --> 00:19:27.250
Look for anyone who might still be alive!

00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:34.750
They're all dead, too...

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:41.080
This has to be divine providence!

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:48.710
The mission was to kill them all.

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:53.000
I am going to turn this girl 
into a Nue executioner.

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:55.340
She'll be a valuable resource 
for Yoshinobu-sama.

00:19:55.340 --> 00:19:57.590
There is no room for exceptions.

00:20:12.990 --> 00:20:14.630
You said it yourself.

00:20:14.630 --> 00:20:18.150
People will betray you, 
whether friend or foe.

00:20:18.520 --> 00:20:21.490
There's no ruling someone's heart.

00:20:24.480 --> 00:20:27.080
I'm going to carry it all.

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:31.630
The grudges, the sorrow, the past, future...

00:20:31.630 --> 00:20:33.160
All of it.

00:20:37.220 --> 00:20:41.170
<i>"Kotodama." The force behind one's words.</i>

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:45.470
I will protect this girl.

00:21:03.420 --> 00:21:05.410
Are you digging graves for them?

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:18.030
Did you kill them?
